*.pt
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
hf_cache/
models/
# Exception: lemat_genbench's own models/ subpackage (ORB/MACE/UMA/Equiformer
# calculator classes + registry.py) is real source, not a weights-cache dir.
# The blanket models/ rule above is intentional -- it's meant to keep
# downloaded model *weight* files out of git (users get those from HF at
# runtime) -- but it happened to share a name with this Python source
# subpackage, so the rule accidentally swept that up too, and this package
# was never actually committed. Without it, score_3mlip.py/verify_combined.py
# fail with ModuleNotFoundError on lemat_genbench.models.registry.
!crystals/lemat/code/py/lemat-genbench/src/lemat_genbench/models/
!crystals/lemat/code/py/lemat-genbench/src/lemat_genbench/models/**
